ll and failed trajectories\",\n      \"repetitions when a direction remains consequential\"\n    ],\n    \"continuation\": \"A direction may continue across multiple rounds when evidence justifies another diagnostic or implementation change; one failed implementation is not a mechanism refutation.\",\n    \"screening\": \"Optional fixed user-hash subsets and internal temporal folds are screening-only. Preserve prevalence and time boundaries; final candidates and controls use the frozen full protocol. Never compare a subset result to a full-data result as if matched.\",\n    \"novelty_score\": null,\n    \"routine_human_approval\": false\n  },\n  \"analysis\": {\n    \"primary\": \"four-task macro ROC-AUC\",\n    \"secondary\": [\n      \"Macro Logloss\",\n      \"All four task AUC/Logloss and changes against reference/entry\",\n      \"Parameters, training cost, inference cost\"\n    ],\n    \"cost_views\": [\n      \"matched training recipe/data passes for mechanism isolation\",\n      \"measured equal-compute or quality-cost frontier for efficiency\"\n    ],\n    \"slices\": [\n      \"hour of day\",\n      \"history length including empty histories\",\n      \"past behavior composition\",\n      \"training-frequency groups\",\n      \"unseen or missing fields\"\n    ],\n    \"slice_rules\": \"Define bins using training data or pre-experiment rules, report sample/positive/negative counts; mark insufficient slices, and distinguish exploratory from predeclared confirmatory findings.\",\n    \"uncertainty\": \"Paired seeds and paired user-cluster bootstrap where feasible; repeated exposures from a user are not independent samples. Report intervals and seed variation without claiming significance from one run.\",\n    \"selection_policy\": {\n      \"id\": \"taobao-four-task-macro-auc-v1\",\n      \"split\": \"validation\",\n      \"tasks\": [\n        \"is_click\",\n        \"cart\",\n        \"fav\",\n        \"buy\"\n      ],\n      \"weights\": {\n        \"is_click\": 0.25,\n        \"cart\": 0.25,\n        \"fav\": 0.25,\n        \"buy\": 0.25\n      },\n      \"primary\": \"macro_auc\",\n      \"direction\": \"maximize\",\n      \"tie_breakers\": [\n        \"macro_logloss ascending\",\n        \"parameters ascending\",\n        \"trial_id ascending\"\n      ],\n      \"missing_task\": \"invalid; never average only the available tasks\",\n      \"regression_policy\": \"Report each task's AUC and Logloss change against the reference and entry model; explain trade-offs in topic decisions. No undeclared per-task veto threshold.\",\n      \"test_policy\": \"Selection uses validation only; freeze before a single held-out assessment. Historical completed test suites remain unchanged.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"implementation_boundary\": {\n    \"agent_editable\": [\n      \"candidate model modules\",\n      \"candidate training-loss hook\",\n      \"prospective experiment plans\",\n      \"evidence-linked agent knowledge\"\n    ],\n    \"host_owned\": [\n      \"raw data identities\",\n      \"causal feature construction and split policy\",\n      \"labels and scorers\",\n      \"resource ledger\",\n      \"held-out execution\",\n      \"read-only knowledge snapshots\"\n    ],\n    \"candidate_interface\": \"Defined by the task adapter at freeze time; must return prediction logits/probabilities with fixed sample identity and information boundary.\",\n    \"protocol_change\": \"Requires a new version and rerun of affected references before any new comparison; no silent changes during search.\"\n  },\n  \"final_assessment\": {\n    \"selection\": \"validation only\",\n    \"freeze\": [\n      \"candidate source/config/checkpoint hashes\",\n      \"selected candidates\",\n      \"closest references\",\n      \"key ablations and matched controls\",\n      \"repetition seeds\",\n      \"assessment commands\"\n    ],\n    \"repetitions\": \"Target three paired seeds for the final candidate and closest controls when budget permits; record om