memory interface is exposed: this evidence-linked prospective proposal preserves local observations and revisions without altering read-only human evidence. '\n'Completed local checks are recorded only after verification; numerical/gradient/masking gates remain pending.'\n)\nvariants=[]\nfor name,file,role in [('task_rank_contrast','candidate.py','candidate'),('task_rank_common','control_common_rank.py','control')]:\n variants.append({'name':name,'file':file,'role':role,'config':config[file],'note':checks+' Source SHA256 '+hashlib.sha256(Path(file).read_bytes()).hexdigest()+'.'})\nassessments=[\n {'knowledge_id':'paper:din','decision':'used','rationale':'Read archived primary weighted-sum/non-normalization mechanism at lines251-283; inherited event pooling stays unchanged.','transformed_mechanism':'No new DIN mechanism; preserve its existing target-conditioned weighted sums while testing a local task-rank readout residual.','variant_names':['task_rank_contrast','task_rank_common'],'nearest_work_difference':'Four-task contrast/common rank maps augment the local memory model; not exact DIN reproduction.','falsifier':'Any unintended inherited pooling change invalidates the preservation comparison.'},\n {'knowledge_id':'unirank-method-infnet','decision':'considered','rationale':'Read pinned benchmark code task hubs/readout/broadcast and section2.3 fallback. R16 task-summary exchange lost to both R12 and g0; this study keeps shared tokens untouched and investigates final task rank maps.','transformed_mechanism':'No INFNet hub/attention/broadcast mechanism or source code adopted.','variant_names':[],'nearest_work_difference':'One added per-task rank map at final existing readout, not repeated categorical/sequence/task aggregation.','falsifier':'Failure of contrast to beat active common source and R12 opposes the local proposed extension; it is not a test of original INFNet.'},\n {'knowledge_id':'unirank-method-est','decision':'considered','rationale':'Card and pinned benc